flowchart LR
    subgraph Demo[Submitted hosted scope]
        Reviewer[Reviewer / Swagger] -->|JWT| API[FastAPI API]
        Platform[Platform onboarding operator] -->|platform key| API
        Gateway[RFID gateway] -->|device token + batches| API
        POS[POS / WMS] -->|idempotent authoritative removal| API

        API -->|tenant-scoped transactions| PG[(PostgreSQL + RLS)]
        API -->|immutable catalog source + durable job| PG
        PG -->|accepted import| Catalog[Catalog worker]
        Catalog -->|validate staging + atomic promotion| PG

        API -->|event ledger + durable inbox| PG
        PG --> Events[Event worker]
        Events -->|effective assignment + stable-zone state| PG
        Events -->|deduped projection updates| PG
        Events --> Quarantine[Quarantine records]
        API -->|item state + transactional outbox| PG

        PG -->|fresh projection + active policy| Replenishment[Policy evaluation]
        Replenishment -->|one active task per store / SKU| PG
    end

    subgraph Future[Production extensions - not deployed]
        Stream[Kafka-compatible event stream]
        Archive[S3-compatible raw archive]
    end

    API -. measured throughput / replay need .-> Stream
    Stream -. independent consumers .-> Events
    API -. retention requirement .-> Archive
